    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b9c71fe69f03b98d164d848",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只需要您给我一点点时间。\n如果您同意，我会向你保证――",
      "source_fingerprint": "63962315da8e5538947f21f2ac0963380343b871969c873b15d89b938885301b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc4894a67d24720c52d03f64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且谷水琴蕾的朋友们\n也来帮忙了。这样应该能坚持一天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f9be909cd80fb4bf8a3e2b45bd1883f36594cd8594b4ffdc87b2c344ac1bea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29730fe73e1ae4067bff4168",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷水琴蕾",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f369ca4b88e8e1e112bbdc6350fea562c8b217773a6c67f202a3296b773c9d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
