    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d9445a95c4ac70e2143f8bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈——哈哈哈～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4adadcda9bd5afbb8c6fe0abfc9d600c293a05d24564e70717df12513c0717",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f97d8130d6b461ecc8af427",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看上去很懂酒的客人",
      "source_fingerprint": "705fe312b90477cdf976c7c77203cd149ea9f15e68b4201ae28eb0ba4bc0ead1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192f4981d0a8f57485028463",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我也算是个有名的作家。\n在这附近，还是有些影响力的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f92ef7dda21c40156dac25756ec9530af5e85333bdd39bdbb2543b99d9ccabb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afbb6eed3c25f55db5ccb3d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看上去很懂酒的客人",
      "source_fingerprint": "705fe312b90477cdf976c7c77203cd149ea9f15e68b4201ae28eb0ba4bc0ead1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b4a9ec16d75172cc1ffec24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是占用我的时间，拿出一杯难喝的酒\n――你知道会怎样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "600c9b6f02612b059c395333158c7c8857891ed59293338b2dc6320dfd10e7b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2b9cc3497d10eff9851f81d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请放心。她一定能够让您满意",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4b168508d3386d632d065c52235836f77bf0dd56077db0483954767acec87fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d272802eb698768526e8f666",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……作为谷水琴蕾的训练员。\n我毫不犹豫地做出了回答――",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b8d2b7a313511387e85bc4c203eb89e1064606059c972720b0c1aac82c2972",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ee6409f185afe38643efb8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请静静等候。她回应期待的那一刻",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e936a848451dab54299dd951bf18be08d692a29acf7325adf12fbafff6de89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3541e5a256cd19e349bdb879",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为，我是见证最多次的人。见证她\n宣称要实现――并实现了目标的瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0192c56403716bb25e51b87a60aa737086cd519881114c9c5a2e93b83b5504",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc0d1fcd74644d4aaa9b364b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷水琴蕾",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f369ca4b88e8e1e112bbdc6350fea562c8b217773a6c67f202a3296b773c9d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
