    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a0c8ec779bbca34e823caa8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她说着给我看的……\n是一段酒保的视频，视频中的酒保\n灵巧地抛接酒瓶，给客人制作酒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06e419bbfeb4fc623090712518f57819593fb11f313b28defb6ecef5a79a904f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
